043,27.7,1976,48,105,21]],"links":[["Stearns County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/minnesota/stearns-county"],["ARC or PLC in Stearns County","/arc-plc/minnesota/stearns-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record for Stearns County runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 14 grids October to November came in under 90% of normal in 37 of 75 years. In 2025, the middle of the grids got 163% of normal in June to July and 67% in January to February. So far in 2026 the middle sits at 53% for January to February and 77% for April to May. Grid 30440 had its driest year in 1976 at 48%.</p>"}
